{"4741260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deadpact", "steam_appid": 4741260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a single-player, story-driven survival horror puzzle game. It combines survival horror with puzzle-solving and exploration. You progress through a narrative while solving interconnected puzzles and dealing with survival mechanics like injuries, infection, hunger, fatigue, and sleep. Each enemy has unique, custom AI behavior. Some track you by sound, while others can make you harm yourself just by looking at them, requiring different strategies to survive. There is also a safe hub area (a tavern) that serves as a narrative resting point where you prepare, recover, and save your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/d003da9a81faccc1b9b09a0fa62f0c2d.poster.avif?t=1781166438\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/d003da9a81faccc1b9b09a0fa62f0c2d.webm?t=1781166438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/d003da9a81faccc1b9b09a0fa62f0c2d.mp4?t=1781166438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Between Descents, the Tavern</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A candlelit tavern is your only place to breathe and prepare: buy strange brews that sharpen your senses, trade for clues, and report to the man who sent you down. Tell him the truth… or don't. Every choice is remembered, and yours decide how this ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/7ca4956c081d71fc41f799f01366c3b4.poster.avif?t=1781166438\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/7ca4956c081d71fc41f799f01366c3b4.webm?t=1781166438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/7ca4956c081d71fc41f799f01366c3b4.mp4?t=1781166438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Horror Has Its Own Rule</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two horrors here hunt the same way and none of them can be fought. Each obeys its own merciless logic, and the only way to live is to read it before it kills you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/9993d6019e1b8d09c319dcdbf03c459d.poster.avif?t=1781166438\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/9993d6019e1b8d09c319dcdbf03c459d.webm?t=1781166438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/9993d6019e1b8d09c319dcdbf03c459d.mp4?t=1781166438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Choices Decide the End</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you surrender, what you keep, and who you choose to trust all steer your fate. Nothing is forgotten and more than one ending waits for you in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/a4bb3e6cf2fe10b6f10face54a33174d.poster.avif?t=1781166438\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/a4bb3e6cf2fe10b6f10face54a33174d.webm?t=1781166438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/a4bb3e6cf2fe10b6f10face54a33174d.mp4?t=1781166438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Severed, Poisoned, Left to Rot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your body is fragile, and the damage sticks. Limbs get torn away, wounds fester and turn septic, and poison creeps through your veins — and every affliction you carry will kill you if you ignore it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/f79dbd3e083fef20f686fcc89f13d6f6.poster.avif?t=1781166438\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/f79dbd3e083fef20f686fcc89f13d6f6.webm?t=1781166438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/f79dbd3e083fef20f686fcc89f13d6f6.mp4?t=1781166438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a single-player, story-driven survival horror puzzle game. It combines survival horror with puzzle-solving and exploration. You progress through a narrative while solving interconnected puzzles and dealing with survival mechanics like injuries, infection, hunger, fatigue, and sleep. Each enemy has unique, custom AI behavior. Some track you by sound, while others can make you harm yourself just by looking at them, requiring different strategies to survive. There is also a safe hub area (a tavern) that serves as a narrative resting point where you prepare, recover, and save your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/d003da9a81faccc1b9b09a0fa62f0c2d.poster.avif?t=1781166438\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/d003da9a81faccc1b9b09a0fa62f0c2d.webm?t=1781166438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/d003da9a81faccc1b9b09a0fa62f0c2d.mp4?t=1781166438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Between Descents, the Tavern</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A candlelit tavern is your only place to breathe and prepare: buy strange brews that sharpen your senses, trade for clues, and report to the man who sent you down. Tell him the truth… or don't. Every choice is remembered, and yours decide how this ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/7ca4956c081d71fc41f799f01366c3b4.poster.avif?t=1781166438\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/7ca4956c081d71fc41f799f01366c3b4.webm?t=1781166438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/7ca4956c081d71fc41f799f01366c3b4.mp4?t=1781166438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Horror Has Its Own Rule</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two horrors here hunt the same way and none of them can be fought. Each obeys its own merciless logic, and the only way to live is to read it before it kills you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/9993d6019e1b8d09c319dcdbf03c459d.poster.avif?t=1781166438\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/9993d6019e1b8d09c319dcdbf03c459d.webm?t=1781166438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/9993d6019e1b8d09c319dcdbf03c459d.mp4?t=1781166438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Choices Decide the End</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you surrender, what you keep, and who you choose to trust all steer your fate. Nothing is forgotten and more than one ending waits for you in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/a4bb3e6cf2fe10b6f10face54a33174d.poster.avif?t=1781166438\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/a4bb3e6cf2fe10b6f10face54a33174d.webm?t=1781166438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/a4bb3e6cf2fe10b6f10face54a33174d.mp4?t=1781166438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Severed, Poisoned, Left to Rot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your body is fragile, and the damage sticks. Limbs get torn away, wounds fester and turn septic, and poison creeps through your veins — and every affliction you carry will kill you if you ignore it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/f79dbd3e083fef20f686fcc89f13d6f6.poster.avif?t=1781166438\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/f79dbd3e083fef20f686fcc89f13d6f6.webm?t=1781166438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/extras/f79dbd3e083fef20f686fcc89f13d6f6.mp4?t=1781166438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Sentenced to death, you're sent into the dark for one last chance at freedom. The things hunting you are not mindless monsters. Each one hunts you, learns your every move, and never forgets. Outsmart them, or die. Every choice you make changes how your story ends.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Indonesian, Dutch, Finnish, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, Norwegian, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish, Swedish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/97635b14106d73ac727c9640bc610d6c339dfae1/header.jpg?t=1781166438", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/decf3d5304b56ecfc928e1056a36aa3067f1807f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781166438", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4741260/decf3d5304b56ecfc928e1056a36aa3067f1807f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781166438", "website": "https://lowhealth.games/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590 / AMD FX-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 2GB / AMD Radeon R9 280 (Shader Model 5.0, DirectX 11)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9600K / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 Super / RTX 2060 6GB / AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Low Health Games"], "publishers": ["Low Health Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 64, "description": "Adjustable Text Size"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 80, "description": "#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 58, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap